settings-page-title = Page range
settings-skip-last-label = Skip trailing pages
settings-skip-last-help = Default 1. Usually skips the reference list at the end of a paper; set 0 to disable skipping by page count.
settings-page-note = Structured paragraphs that Zotero marks as references are still skipped. The page limit uses physical PDF pages.
settings-speed-title = Speed and reliability
settings-max-concurrent-label = Maximum concurrent requests
settings-max-concurrent-help = Default 2. Usually much faster than serial requests while avoiding too many at once.
settings-request-gap-label = Request start gap (ms)
settings-request-gap-help = Default 250. Raise to 500–1000 if a free public service rate-limits you.
settings-max-chars-label = Maximum characters per request
settings-max-chars-help = Default 2800. Long paragraphs are split into smaller chunks to reduce request failures.
settings-max-batch-label = Paragraphs per merged request
settings-max-batch-help = Default 6. Short paragraphs are merged within the character limit; if the service does not preserve the markers, they are retried one by one. Set 1 to disable merging.
settings-timeout-label = Request timeout (ms)
settings-timeout-help = Default 60000. Prevents a broken service from occupying the task; raise it for slower local models.
settings-max-errors-label = Pause after consecutive failures
settings-max-errors-help = Default 3. Stops a broken service from requesting the whole paper.
settings-save = Save settings
settings-cache-title = Translation cache
settings-clear-cache = Clear translation cache
settings-cache-help = The cache has an automatic size limit with least-recently-used eviction, so preferences do not grow forever.
