settings-ollama-url-label = Service URL
settings-ollama-model-label = Model
settings-test-ollama = Test Ollama connection
settings-refresh-title = Refreshing
settings-refresh-help = After changing the backend or speed settings, return to the PDF and choose Retranslate the whole document from the right-click menu. Old tasks are cancelled, failed results are cleared, and pending paragraphs are rescheduled with the current settings.
